  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon seasoned salt (such as LAWRY'S®)",
    "1 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "1 tablespoon onion powder",
    "1 tablespoon ground paprika",
    "2 teaspoons Worcestershire sauce",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 teaspoon liquid smoke flavoring",
    "4 bone-in pork chops (1/2 to 3/4 inch thick)"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for indirect cooking over medium heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zUYQiUBBspkYX2t_TKXTJaJigZI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218068-smoky-grilled-pork-chops-VAT-005-step-01-859cf7ced79947c38e50a960b29388c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218068/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the wet spice rub: Mix seasoned salt, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, pepper, and liquid smoke together in a small bowl until thoroughly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aZoY3oEHUUj1yNXptvipQMDTmrs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218068-smoky-grilled-pork-chops-VAT-006-step-02-4204af20b1d04b3e8a0eb4fcc025ce84.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218068/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Massage spice rub on both sides of pork chops; let stand for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qpuRs6M_YgXqA__qGc5eG-8VR-U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218068-smoky-grilled-pork-chops-VAT-007-step-03-11a69a3350bc4c0d8c570a646764ec19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218068/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook chops on the preheated grill over indirect heat until no longer pink inside, about 12 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer should read at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4phcqvftBkpfm9fOQDT3XC8uzbU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218068-smoky-grilled-pork-chops-VAT-008-step-04-923029a0e19d414f8a4ad096f90c5f6a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218068/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let stand for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XSF0a6o41LoJ3gcDoUCHi3Nc0s4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218068-smoky-grilled-pork-chops-VAT-001-4x3-d739732dc177480ba341378d901e1525.jpg"
